.el .ds Aq '
.TH disconnect 1  "disconnect " 
.SH NAME
disconnect \- Remove murk\*(Aqs entry from an AI editor\*(Aqs MCP config. No CLIENT clears every configured editor. `\-\-rotate` also revokes the grant and rotates its keys
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmurk agent disconnect\fR [\fB\-\-rotate\fR] [\fB\-\-name\fR] [\fB\-\-vault\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fICLIENT\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove murk\*(Aqs entry from an AI editor\*(Aqs MCP config. No CLIENT clears every configured editor. `\-\-rotate` also revokes the grant and rotates its keys
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-rotate\fR
Revoke the grant and rotate the keys it could read
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fI<NAME>\fR [default: mcp]
Grant name to revoke with \-\-rotate
.TP
\fB\-\-vault\fR \fI<VAULT>\fR [default: .murk]
Vault filename
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fICLIENT\fR]
Editor to disconnect. Omit for every configured editor
